    Pass 2 discipline:
        NO CSS/Tailwind changes. If data makes layout look weird — log it, do not fix it.
        NO loading spinners or skeleton loaders. Use plain text "Loading..." or empty slot.
        NO error UI. On failure: console.error only, no "Not Found" pages.

